{"request_id": "9069:7", "dialogue_id": 9069, "turn": 7, "text": "那好吧，麻烦你帮我处理退款了", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "8a40b26e7fd3c2a3f9b9943bed5143311d71e0fb8ccfdb14236354e689b4fc26"}
{"request_id": "7028:1", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 1, "text": "那能只退其中一件吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "5436986949dc64c27fff338f930881c462bf0499b785a61214d3705b3ddebb26"}
{"request_id": "9069:10", "dialogue_id": 9069, "turn": 10, "text": "没有了，这次弄好了就可以，谢谢啊", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "7b840661208b0229b9085851af0ba9e27eb14f57a51a2f03fcf1c0a0fa59b7ad"}
{"request_id": "9069:9", "dialogue_id": 9069, "turn": 9, "text": "那行，谢谢你。以后我可得记得把自动续费关了。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "e12853b5d03452241450f39ac9e3a0f8163fc2d6cec8d8c0ff0d558de1cbebb3"}
