{"request_id": "7028:2", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 2, "text": "你好。我上周买的那个联动促销套餐，里面有个空气炸锅和破壁机，现在空气炸锅不想要了，订单还能取消其中一个吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "0cedd87ee58467d6fc69a9719d031d0c1d805963be694a812fbcc755c81bc2b1"}
{"request_id": "7028:4", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 4, "text": "我发现有一件商品买错了，这件可以单独退吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "cfb9419c75314653abbb134e080a99d34c07410592a5045b1eefe6028485f4b6"}
{"request_id": "7028:5", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 5, "text": "就是其中有一个商品我现在不想要了，能退掉这一个吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "8da40ad50bd8f7c57e2ecc39486bcbbe24d1004937d24c216a2fff75392ed906"}
{"request_id": "7028:6", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 6, "text": "对，就取消裤子这一单", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "1c66bf3e6a0f215240263ae34ad53c52d26e734c335b5bfc598ccf853e947b45"}
{"request_id": "7028:8", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 8, "text": "这样操作不会把我鞋子也给退了吧？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "99740b1571c1463fd7e9e6915436819f1934f1dd51d4ccd526aee14167cafaca"}
{"request_id": "7028:10", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 10, "text": "好的，那我就放心了，谢谢你的解答。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "3766a5d0d0732f74a41dba3d6c2b9cc3218e01c3eea494987da87e0d526e3648"}
{"request_id": "7028:7", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 7, "text": "啊，那我就是两个都不能要了是吗？为什么啊？难道不能只退一个吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "4667d7cc524287020054a6408aeb94af01ddf2a1a20798e9a7176b5159c220c9"}
{"request_id": "7028:11", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 11, "text": "没问题了，谢谢你的耐心解答！", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "376166d566dd27168ebf848a94db25321b2191ddbe2c40b4efd0b1bce8e3861e"}
{"request_id": "7028:9", "dialogue_id": 7028, "turn": 9, "text": "好的，那我就等鞋子到了之后，先确认收货，然后再去申请裤子的退款。谢谢你的解答！", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "2ff15124b31ad8769c890e6c7c66877be2e61fcda434e1cbbc69d782f51a0009"}
{"request_id": "10611:1", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 1, "text": "你好，我前几天在你们这买的鞋子，尺码买错了，想换个码。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "7b5f23b9295da4968352a0102e8fdd5a691ecd88cb0029415f17c113ab3adb68"}
{"request_id": "10611:2", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 2, "text": "凭什么非得等厂商检测单？\n你们办事效率也太低了，明天到底能不能按时来取换货给个准话！", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "31b589d797f33c8bd0dd1478d3b81e17baab33a2e9dc89511eb98bc127c356dc"}
{"request_id": "10611:4", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 4, "text": "行，我也懂了，就是你们一直拖呗。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "3f4b35b4de03f175c6d81e50fe72fc3ea09ad085e2dae60ef43a5f73b719166a"}
{"request_id": "10611:6", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 6, "text": "行，退货就退货吧，真服了，换货这么麻烦。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "88fd4a830d9e1954cd5b72539ee45955f426b0114cc08c1b2ac445a425cdb0f6"}
{"request_id": "10611:3", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 3, "text": "我说你们这是什么意思？等了一天连个屁都不放，约定好的时间说不作数就不作数了？行，我现在就去你们店里，当面看看你们到底是怎么“检测”的！", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "8b2b5fbe336b9af3676b163249be05a3b0ff03486d5678739466cd04c8da3ed0"}
{"request_id": "10611:9", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 9, "text": "好的，就看你们效率了，先退了吧", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "03e743f391412e739b1f942fdabdd0efbf99dd346aee640fca6a1d79450b2dda"}
{"request_id": "10611:5", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 5, "text": "这都三个小时了，早干什么去了？我现在严重怀疑你们这就是在故意拖延时间，不想给我换货。办理无理由退货，那我买的东西不就白买了吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "c656bc85e1054eda7c492949acfef28991295e894351c5ce3af79b625616c103"}
{"request_id": "10611:10", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 10, "text": "在啊，没拆。赶紧给我退。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "bc52f7df8e8de485ba78ef9918776a2ece1cf3b7533f58797ea1233c3c51b6a8"}
{"request_id": "10611:8", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 8, "text": "难道我还得自己解决吗？你们自营的，出了问题不应该你们负责到底吗？我可不想和厂家扯皮。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "542ad83cb387c345928414632a340f7e2fd7286b044b59bb4a53db0040385b51"}
{"request_id": "10611:11", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 11, "text": "那退款什么时候能到账啊？别又拖个几天。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "a77938b38bb203aeddd32c163b686ec5f66c24d76887f1226c2fce87f905224a"}
{"request_id": "10611:7", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 7, "text": "够了，别跟我玩套路。现在要么给我换，要么退钱。你们上门检测的速度也太慢了，哪个厂商检测需要那么久？再拖我就投诉你们了。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "64962f4dcb641e318750fe6a850eba6e6c0af3521073d2f1202f378a2e0b243b"}
{"request_id": "10611:12", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 12, "text": "那退的和送新的能同时进行吗？不然我得多等几天。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "0ae1e1ddef620b9326cdb0b5780d56a2533543fc5d33585f200b2d2d1ebb6c28"}
{"request_id": "10611:13", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 13, "text": "希望这次能顺利解决问题，别再让我等这么长时间了。还有，别忘了通知取件的时候顺便送新货来。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "18f059356b40ce038371cb699a0d548d721c3aca0d512dcfcdc7acb88de84284"}
{"request_id": "10611:15", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 15, "text": "哎，希望这次买新的能顺利点，别再出这种岔子了。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "ce19873d03a56131cbc0f66bcd59716bd2762e91d8d1a3006b2abcf9872cbf66"}
{"request_id": "10611:14", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 14, "text": "好的，谢谢你。\n那我先买了，别忘了让他们明天来的时候把新的也带来。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "c6e1abda69f097cd8b1ca612475cf0412f7faae9d951992f7fbb718ed9aa5eec"}
{"request_id": "10611:16", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 16, "text": "好的，希望这次买的没有问题，效率能高点儿。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "ccb2a4801d627edeecdfac5d7722996cbcc55af804660f2b1a50fb6144180e07"}
{"request_id": "10611:17", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 17, "text": "懂了，退款就行了，快点处理。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "122a23b18c159b8b4cac7a6f72fd21320616493d1f285858d6621a5b6b65556d"}
{"request_id": "10611:18", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 18, "text": "好的，那我再买一个直接送过来，能行吧？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "9d07ffa757307be02cf407162bc89bebc7557b69350bc5712826c26b135d2cc4"}
{"request_id": "10611:19", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 19, "text": "行，那我就重新买一个吧，谢谢你。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "301c7e496388e895df2b793729ece9a607f24ed3e94d6ac3d47225a5358b19c5"}
{"request_id": "9347:3", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 3, "text": "那有没有什么条件？可以直接领吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "fe0c1a4d621cfea54c810022ede1b5ba2043b739a1f33259f3fb40e77a19fe00"}
{"request_id": "9347:2", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 2, "text": "我刚才问的是开通京东会员能不能领爱奇艺会员啊？有啥条件不？能直接领吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "b4d1f71099aa648c0018cee849f8669d9776eb5e66d0e0f873d25f55295e8a91"}
{"request_id": "9347:5", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 5, "text": "那要怎样开通呢，是不是很简单？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "24c6184cf0c412824149c46a99d5ddd1cd643760d02474ebdc9efc196d5dc9b6"}
{"request_id": "9347:1", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 1, "text": "我前阵子不是开通了京东会员嘛，想问下是不是能领爱奇艺会员啊？有啥条件没？是直接就能领吗？还有啊，我订单里的商品一直显示不出来，这是咋回事啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "ad219650c16e464448f5f91f63c77f7f35b919807c32566b1386a0749b7e7a3f"}
{"request_id": "9347:4", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 4, "text": "那是不是可以直接领？我订单里的商品一直不出来，能帮忙看看咋回事吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "ca4fc616d4d332803ee14ffa5e77d663254a99b7369ac656b631a4d3a71e9327"}
{"request_id": "9347:7", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 7, "text": "已经发给您了。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "6f51def47a401757f8814af33918cf3a64f26cf4f0df0d4c3b6196a9748fa64b"}
{"request_id": "10611:20", "dialogue_id": 10611, "turn": 20, "text": "好的，那辛苦你了，谢谢。\n真没想到换个货这么麻烦，折腾这么一圈最后还是得退货重买。\n希望能快点把退款搞定吧，新家电什么时候能送过来啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "05ca4b66be1c2f8f53e33427866178f658e5c0cee5f241109bafc4e6e698042e"}
{"request_id": "9347:8", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 8, "text": "行，麻烦你转接一下。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "68380e5f20b85ba816d41d9024ae69bc57ba3aa8aa96f8a999526c2621cd57d7"}
{"request_id": "9347:6", "dialogue_id": 9347, "turn": 6, "text": "好的，但我刚才查了一下，我的订单里的商品怎么一直不出来，是怎么回事？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "817f35dff8b23a109d5b040f556d85d256b7cc682d8fd16ede225034a0b3ab88"}
{"request_id": "346:1", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 1, "text": "你好，我上周在你们这儿买的空调，想咨询一下这个安装费要怎么报销啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "abc2cfadaeec8963292d4e7c2a8b9310b1ba585515e5e89fe1d7c79aea3fc6e6"}
{"request_id": "346:3", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 3, "text": "已经装好了，我想问下这个安装费怎么报销啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "af600fce7bf232fe1c30a3e3b8708fcab5535b64e29ec615a2a52fb2f9fd08f6"}
{"request_id": "346:2", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 2, "text": "好的，麻烦您帮我查查安装费怎么报销。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "50713a10d2a51003216adba68a0da330e433dad977610b999ccc69205adceaaf"}
{"request_id": "346:4", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 4, "text": "那这个安装费怎么报销啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "92c07316030ea805f1ca023a6590335a7abfbdbb6fd3b5c1571b9de4494079ca"}
{"request_id": "346:7", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 7, "text": "这个邮箱是？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "76661d17c84277da22e19806b310cdac815bab4208768898697adc40f6942c66"}
{"request_id": "346:5", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 5, "text": "是厂家那边收的安装费，能给我开个发票吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "a2f30ed5c2cb3b199eb7d9799d9abe3d7c32587a3d61e793a9e2db088abfe9ed"}
{"request_id": "346:10", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 10, "text": "暂时没有了", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "2d5f423773f2bcf990ebc26708e36b9c2a47c8ba6b67d3463be325c806390be3"}
{"request_id": "346:6", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 6, "text": "哦？真的吗？那太感谢了！怎么报销呢？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "46df83d942e1ca5381e0ac519dfb86252f3f4b095abff417491bdaebf7a7c5b7"}
{"request_id": "346:9", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 9, "text": "那我要发邮件给你们，大概多久能收到退款啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "48f5f9b8a83f641d9bde5c055c1286e668397c81d89dd5ea9be008e166dc0d1f"}
{"request_id": "8833:2", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 2, "text": "您好，我想咨询一下回收订单的事情。我想知道最晚去门店交货的时间是什么时候？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "d58fdebdd4a19ff301cd44a31a2787b523566e9ae538254e045469531e33f76a"}
{"request_id": "8833:1", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 1, "text": "那万一我忘了去，订单是不是就直接作废了？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "50cc675fc435efa606e8f461f238358560855199c1770ebf8dd96ebdb325ec2d"}
{"request_id": "346:8", "dialogue_id": 346, "turn": 8, "text": "哦，明白了。那我需要把订单号和收费单据拍个照发到你的邮箱里是吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "fba8c4d7549b81bbf36ab9092354c47e617725e53320fa6cc7f9f8a1edd92c19"}
{"request_id": "8833:3", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 3, "text": "那如果我提交过了最晚时间，订单会自动失效吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "8458724e2628564f0d6175699c08f0615521e32ecc73ebbce6df6b7c5e316be3"}
{"request_id": "8833:4", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 4, "text": "那如果超过了这个时间，我的订单会失效吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "deb5503964bda9570aa0d066fbaac1f5304de85dd15521e8909df7283dbbdab4"}
{"request_id": "8833:6", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 6, "text": "那要是过了这个最晚提交时间，订单是不是就自动失效啦？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "1eaca13c8e211f6207de916ef3d9c9dc9ecb8e3b460f3e1bacd901dff952b5f0"}
{"request_id": "8833:5", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 5, "text": "那我如果超过了这个时间没去，订单会不会自动失效啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "4bd34831d6a97057b600bfc7c9652e9fcc67dd7c8e749ae025aa7a42700df72a"}
{"request_id": "8833:7", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 7, "text": "那优惠券会返还给我吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "2a7084ecdfd0fcd9b8ed6be7d72312ed9e502744080cc5645729999e1ce27666"}
{"request_id": "8833:8", "dialogue_id": 8833, "turn": 8, "text": "我提供截图，您就能确保券还回来吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "0ffc8c77448a3322c3d0c8c39852d18c3d7ffb4fe467c76e743948b6ca675ff3"}
{"request_id": "321:4", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 4, "text": "我买的是路由器", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "926e645ddaa7e0bdec259a3ed26f27144342f8a1656655f7bc02d792afc535dd"}
{"request_id": "321:3", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 3, "text": "我买的东西没收到，是不是丢了啊，这要咋整啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "75f5874bd405f95a37111159ff7e3577673aa2b952157e261e63ceb1fb215010"}
{"request_id": "321:1", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 1, "text": "喂，你好。我这个快递好像丢了，到现在都没动静，这该怎么处理啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "4b6ef9831b4bfd1c005e16d1ead403a5d08c36c82f478aec1f0f34f06b1c2e70"}
{"request_id": "321:2", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 2, "text": "买的电饭煲，物流一直停在同一个位置两天没动了，你们能不能帮我问问，是不是丢了？要是丢了，能给我补发吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "485f33fc7214f791cefbd09e3bd4f39d308c76f2314edfed8fa7223028fe695c"}
{"request_id": "321:7", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 7, "text": "他电话打不通，现在该怎么办啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "549aa389c7c01d159d06a0b0420e91814f5968a9f45097327570bd28dd80d4a8"}
{"request_id": "321:5", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 5, "text": "我也忘了买的啥了，就记得下单了", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "96461b5bfb2001696f953663ef2cfb1555134c7b06df8257e58368ecbe325750"}
{"request_id": "321:6", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 6, "text": "对啊，我买的包裹到现在还没收到，是不是路上弄丢了？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "1db3e4586c5a707108c823735cd03fd8036a530d95109c2f58a4f58e10816a2d"}
{"request_id": "8887:1", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 1, "text": "长沙这边上门收件的电话是多少？\n还有就是，你们长沙这边有站点的联系方式吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "56d548fa2071f645033e1e9bad1b4eebe617c14a55a728bc5bbc5a649df8c4c2"}
{"request_id": "8887:3", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 3, "text": "我在长沙这边，长沙上门收件打哪个电话啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "e1408856cf0fb2380ef49b6611e3bea8668b8f88bd9c4112e59df7718f0ca4b5"}
{"request_id": "321:8", "dialogue_id": 321, "turn": 8, "text": "配送员说找不到路，让我自己去站点取，可是我东西都付了钱的，你们得负责给我送到家啊。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "77126e4d65ad77ba4990fb5ff32ee5def1153e0fb15ca0be8e3e01ecd89cc287"}
{"request_id": "8887:6", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 6, "text": "那上门取件的快递费要和快递员结算吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "ede1c32ec7672c53bc139fef63ba330f7412b08ca1b161f97af0b0e23782fc28"}
{"request_id": "8887:7", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 7, "text": "嗯，那有没有站点的联系方式？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "2f57a03f255f25f4c954fae0e2fc92864dac85717fd6adc9f327e000b243c322"}
{"request_id": "8887:2", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 2, "text": "对啊，上门取件，我在长沙这边，是直接打快递员的电话，还是有什么站点的联系方式啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "5e5af86ff7fdaf9bc4ab1188395b747e5301bef49be448218c9e68a9e0b1105b"}
{"request_id": "8887:4", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 4, "text": "那请问我需要自己联系快递员吗？还有，费用是需要当场给快递员吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "4587cc94b81dc925cdff99f3d8fdf2dd836df5aaeec634b94e15905607769220"}
{"request_id": "8887:8", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 8, "text": "已经开通了啊 。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "093d7f5711b2d87b70ba0060c7679db1a94f6be4c5d6bce1efa75e58824621e1"}
{"request_id": "8887:10", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 10, "text": "那费用是跟快递员结吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "59c7d40d6b3938b66e5ad3aea8ca69c00987a76fe55687a749d3e05a896c6fbe"}
{"request_id": "8887:11", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 11, "text": "有站点的联系方式吗", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "4ec1df786abada15ec961d1d5ca948870de2909b3f212d5df944dcd71828b854"}
{"request_id": "8887:13", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 13, "text": "好的，那站点的座机号码是？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "1dc6c2b31716e5438f2fa718614bb30f5619653b5fb3d2efd5b1c0825c08dc48"}
{"request_id": "8887:5", "dialogue_id": 8887, "turn": 5, "text": "那我这售后服务已经申请好了，是不是会有个快递员或者站点的联系电话发给我？还是说系统会自动安排人来收件，我不用管？\n\n另外，邮费是我直接给快递员还是怎么搞的？需要现结吗？还是你们系统会自动扣？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "d0a34f1f9a7eb0575d3125d554388761b66b0bf1a484c402e30ee1491deea19d"}
{"request_id": "1906:2", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 2, "text": "并没有啊，我现在想问的是你们怎么解决这个问题呢？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "04134c0534c7e741246ca9ab9c222298a1c4db9901cad74aecf720ef2b7a88ef"}
{"request_id": "1906:3", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 3, "text": "没有啊，到现在都没有收到，这个配送员是京东的吗？你们能不能给我打电话说一下到底是什么情况？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "f745495607f522f9bd089af03b19493a7e310dabc30169709522b90e53f779a4"}
{"request_id": "1906:1", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 1, "text": "我刚查了一下物流信息，显示我的货已签收，但我根本还没收到啊，这怎么办？还有啊，这个配送员是你们京东自己的人吗？我现在要求你电话联系我。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "25faa4371115e4854c2e721d4a10eae5f7d05767cf8d5a4350205a739c07772a"}
{"request_id": "1906:6", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 6, "text": "是京东的配送员吗", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "7ad4b9d3cd9cc4de50cdf153fc6db07935eec691438e02f2eaaf176c5b4a901f"}
{"request_id": "1906:5", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 5, "text": "怎么会发生这种事情啊？我该怎么办？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "77cc8c930033e832b803dc99652929939980bd14237dd3981791e16eb75e13db"}
{"request_id": "1906:4", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 4, "text": "能先确认下配送员是京东的还是第三方吗？\n另外能让配送员或者你们直接打电话联系我吗？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "e2098f237a41a0b14ee79d26953f20f2c9979533d6b9ced1924022ab79faa637"}
{"request_id": "1906:8", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 8, "text": "行，你们一定要尽快处理啊，我可等着收货呢。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "a0e949dde4db27d975270fd82a46f63b68fdf6771249060528630eceb17a2974"}
{"request_id": "1906:9", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 9, "text": "行，那我等你们电话，希望你们能快点解决问题。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "9bc12cd5ad753f28fb3d4c56f093f5373543d56a89627ba7a54ade77193aad29"}
{"request_id": "1906:7", "dialogue_id": 1906, "turn": 7, "text": "我没收到啊，麻烦你查查那个快递员是不是京东的。我现在急用这个货，你赶紧给我解决，要不就给我打电话，快点！", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "380dea0e6d1ef3af5815f1e66002dda17819fe4e25e7fec208bbbf01f778445d"}
